      "title": "Update RPL dissector with path control subfields",
      "message": "Update RPL dissector with path control subfields\n\nRFC 6550 describes the path control field of the RPL transit option with\nsubfields corresponding to preferences (Figure 27).\n\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6550#section-6.7.8\n",
